{title: A Better Life}
{artist: Grace VanderWaal}
{album: Just the Beginning}
{key: Am}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Your eyes
[C]They speak to me
[Am]But I don't know what they are saying [G]
[Am]But I think I know what you are [C]thinking
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]So close your eyes [C]
And [Am]create yourself a better life
Let the [Am]wind blow through your [G]hair
Let the [F]music take you [C]there
And [Am]make a better [G]life
A [Am]better [G]life
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]You found a lighter
On the [C]street
[Am]And suddenly everything just
Seems so [G]happy
[Am]My honey it's all [C]temporary
{end_of_verse}

